//  ccwrap llibcxx03: <variant> for Open Watcom. Open Watcom has no variadic
//  templates, so this is a FIXED-ARITY variant of up to 10 alternatives
//  (variant<T0[,T1[,...[,T9]]]>). Unused slots default to a private __nil type.
//  Storage is an aligned buffer (a C++03 union cannot hold non-trivial types);
//  construct/copy/destroy dispatch on the runtime index via a switch. Provides
//  index(), holds_alternative<T>, get<T>/get_if<T> (by type), get<I> (by index)
//  and emplace(). visit() is omitted (needs the metaprogramming Open Watcom
//  can't express).
